{"id":"wb-6-904","name":"徐向前故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"徐向前故居","text":"徐向前故居位于中国山西省五台县东冶镇永安村，是中国人民解放军元帅徐向前的故居，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n徐向前故居始建于清道光初年，1990年重修。故居是典型的晋北传统民居建筑，坐北朝南，一进两院，占地面积约900平方米，院内为青砖瓦房。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BE%90%E5%90%91%E5%89%8D%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":93353591,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93353591","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8211f65eb2259715357521f5.jpg","title":"Wutai_Xu_Xiangqian_Guju_2013.08.28_14-23-41.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wutai_Xu_Xiangqian_Guju_2013.08.28_14-23-41.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1a/Wutai_Xu_Xiangqian_Guju_2013.08.28_14-23-41.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​五台县东冶镇徐向前故居——\n文保碑","width":320,"height":213},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}